{"exercise_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S284-EXERCISE-284YH","hint_ordinal":1,"id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S284-HINT-284YH-01","provenance":{"basis":"active Hint macro associated with source segment 284Yh","kind":"source-derived-hint-map"},"record_type":"hint","rights_id":"O007-RIGHTS-FREMLIN-DSL","schema_version":"1.1.0","segment_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S284-SEG-284YH","semantic_anchor":"284Yh","source_anchor":"284Yh","source_line_start":1578,"source_raw_tex_sha256":"b592dfb8df68d307e4edc815001a83026147af2237dbf47e80f8ed6398967c21","source_text":"reduce to the case $M=\\pi$.   Looking at the Fourier\nseries of $f\\restr\\ocint{-\\pi,\\pi}$, show that $f$ is expressible in the\nform $f(x)=\\sum_{k=-m}^mc_ke^{ikx}$ for almost every\n$x\\in\\ocint{-\\pi,\\pi}$.   Now compute $\\varhatf(2n+\\bover12)$ for large\n$n$.","target_line_start":1437,"target_raw_tex_sha256":"c99b7874723c41135d08dfbf182b8ce44fa8b19d581b184e17575ee402c92499","target_text":"Reduksikan ke kasus $M=\\pi$. Dengan menelaah deret Fourier\ndari $f\\restr\\ocint{-\\pi,\\pi}$, tunjukkan bahwa $f$ dapat dinyatakan sebagai\n$f(x)=\\sum_{k=-m}^mc_ke^{ikx}$ untuk hampir setiap\n$x\\in\\ocint{-\\pi,\\pi}$. Kemudian hitung $\\varhatf(2n+\\bover12)$ untuk $n$\nbesar.","unit_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S284"}
